  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>• About our brand and products:</strong>We create science-backed supplements designed for real results — not just great labels. Our products are formulated with clinically studied ingredients, transparent dosing, and no fillers. Whether you're into fitness, daily wellness, or optimizing your health, we have something that works.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>• What makes us different:</strong>We're obsessive about quality — every product is third-party tested and built on real research. Our customers see genuine results, which is why they come back. When you promote us, you're standing behind something you can be proud of.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong>You earn <strong>15% commission</strong> on every order placed through your unique link or coupon code. Commissions are tracked with a <strong>30-day cookie window</strong>, so you get credit even if your audience buys days later. Payments are processed via PayPal, bank transfer, Venmo, or store credit — your choice.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>• How to promote us:</strong>Share your unique affiliate link or coupon code on Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, your podcast, blog, or anywhere your audience is. We recommend posting honest reviews, unboxings, daily routine content, or \"what I take\" style videos — authentic content converts best. We'll provide product photos, approved claims, and content tips to help you get started.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>• Other information:</strong>All applications are reviewed manually — we want to make sure it's a great fit on both sides. Once approved, you'll get access to your personal dashboard to track clicks, sales, and earnings in real time. We're here to support you — reach out anytime and we'll help you succeed.</p></div></div>",
